    {"id":25,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1180,-760],"size":[2080,220],"flags":{},"order":24,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["# FLUX.2 Klein 9B native four-reference workflow - no character LoRA\n\nTested locally on 2026-08-24 at 832x1248, four Euler/simple steps, CFG 1, seed 8675311, and four genuine photos at 0.40 MP each. The references are native FLUX.2 conditioning in semantic order: front face, three-quarter face, upper body, full-body build. No character LoRA, identity adapter, crop, mask, face swap, composite, restoration, sharpening, or post-processing.\n\nBest untouched run: 14.1 seconds after model load, held-out identity centroid 0.6618, weakest held-out view 0.5368. It is the fast option, but Dev remains slightly better for identity (0.6865) and scene detail. Visual review remains required."]}
